---
description: Plain Astro migration rules for this personal site
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo is a **plain Astro** rebuild of arshadmehmood.com. Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/plain-astro-restart.md`. Ignore `MIGRATION_PLAN.md`.

Do not use Starlight, Pelagornis, or any npm blog theme. Do not merge the failed `codex/astro-starlight-migration` branch. Production `master` stays Jekyll until the fixture URL test is green. Do not auto-deploy this branch.

Canonical URLs come from `tests/fixtures/jekyll-sitemap.xml`. Redirects are aliases only. Keep ugly live paths. Giscus on posts only. Static files in `public/`. Fail the build if the `today-i-learned` submodule is missing.
